# Radiation-Shielding-Research private repository
# README-aligned retention policy:
# - keep the current scientific workflow, final Phase-I evidence, final source-reconstruction provenance,
#   documentation, GitHub-safe dataset distribution, and Phase-II work;
# - omit local reconstructed bulk data, caches/builds, and superseded development history.

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local authoritative dataset
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# data/ is intentionally not tracked directly. It must be reconstructed
# from datasets/github/ using:
# datasets/github/_distribution_meta/DATASET_RECONSTRUCTION.md
/data/

# Optional local reconstruction scratch target.
/datasets/reconstructed/

# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Historical/checkpoint material not needed for the active reproduction path
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------
/archive/
/research/phase2/eeg_math_transfer/archive/

